<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-3015] Fix GridGain references in Javadoc</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-3015</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;There are a number of references to GridGain classes still in Ignite&apos;s Javadoc, like GridCompute* and GridNode. &lt;br/&gt;
Not a big deal, but kind of nice to clean up. &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;discussed (briefly) here: &lt;a href=&quot;http://apache-ignite-developers.2346864.n4.nabble.com/clean-up-some-GridGain-references-in-javadoc-td8488.html&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;http://apache-ignite-developers.2346864.n4.nabble.com/clean-up-some-GridGain-references-in-javadoc-td8488.html&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
