                            <comment id="15243963" author="githubbot" created="Sat, 16 Apr 2016 02:42:18 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;GitHub user matthoffman opened a pull request:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/ignite/pull/650&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/ignite/pull/650&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-3015&quot; title=&quot;Fix GridGain references in Javadoc&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;IGNITE-3015&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;IGNITE-3015&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; - Clean up some GridGain references in Javadoc&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    There&apos;s actually at least one instance here that isn&apos;t in javadoc:  &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;VisorTopologyCommand.scala&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt;( &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/ignite/compare/master...matthoffman:fix-javadoc?expand=1#diff-42ef001f2f672329b5ff1f83ca68606dL155&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/ignite/compare/master...matthoffman:fix-javadoc?expand=1#diff-42ef001f2f672329b5ff1f83ca68606dL155&lt;/a&gt;). A couple are in log messages, and the rest are in comments.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    I&apos;m sure I didn&apos;t get them all, but it&apos;s at least a fair number.&lt;/p&gt;


&lt;p&gt;You can merge this pull request into a Git repository by running:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    $ git pull &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/matthoffman/ignite&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/matthoffman/ignite&lt;/a&gt; fix-javadoc&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Alternatively you can review and apply these changes as the patch at:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/ignite/pull/650.patch&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/ignite/pull/650.patch&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;To close this pull request, make a commit to your master/trunk branch&lt;br/&gt;
with (at least) the following in the commit message:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    This closes #650&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;commit 575358fa67983d539c1d515e7ff85fcfd93e821b&lt;br/&gt;
