Date:   2016-04-15T14:35:30Z&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    Updating some outdated class names in javadoc.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    These include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;alternate&quot; type=&quot;square&quot;&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;GridCompute* (removing the &quot;Grid&quot;)&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;GridNode ( -&amp;gt; ClusterNode)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;commit 4f2858e865360c8bb47e05b13a5785216f53788c&lt;br/&gt;
